## Архитектура пайплайна

```mermaid
graph TD
    STL["STL-файл"] --> A["Step 0: HumanAlign<br/>(alignment.py)"]
    A --> B["Step 1: Sensor<br/>(sensor.py)"]
    B -->|"List[SliceMetrics]"| C["Step 2: Approximator<br/>(approximator.py)"]
    C -->|"ApproximationResult<br/>+ SensorTelemetry YAML"| D{"confidence ≥ 0.7?"}
    D -->|"Нет"| MR["manual_review_required"]
    D -->|"Да"| E["Step 3: Synthesizer<br/>(synthesizer.py / langgraph)"]
    E -->|"build123d code"| F["Step 4: Judge<br/>(judge.py)"]
    F -->|"Phase 1: syntax + topology"| G{"Phase 1 OK?"}
    G -->|"Нет"| H{"retry < 3?"}
    H -->|"Да"| E
    H -->|"Нет"| FAIL["failure"]
    G -->|"Да + STEP"| I["Phase 2: IoU"]
    I -->|"IoU ≥ 0.98"| J["Step 5: Optimizer<br/>(optimizer.py)"]
    I -->|"IoU < 0.98"| H
    J --> K["Step 6: CAM<br/>(cam_export.py)"]
    K --> OUT["G-code + STEP + Manifest"]

    style MR fill:#f59e0b,color:#000
    style FAIL fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style OUT fill:#22c55e,color:#000
```

