- [beautify_code()](file:///c:/additive-light%20_dev/gdi_core/optimizer/optimizer.py#130-164) regex [(\D)(\d+\.?\d*)(\D)](file:///c:/additive-light%20_dev/tests/test_quality_gates.py#24-27) может ломать строки, комментарии и переменные

